<!-- ONYX RP: NATIONS & WAR — unit types (milestones M5-M7).

     Firepower / Armor / Mobility / Range are 0..100 and feed the combat power
     formula. Cost is paid once when a unit is raised; Upkeep is charged every
     simulated game day and multiplied by strength, mobilisation and funding.

     VehicleModel / VehicleCount are used ONLY by the tactical spawner, which
     materialises real vehicles near the player. Names carrying a "?" below are
     candidates that still need verifying in game — until they are verified the
     spawner falls back to soldiers on foot rather than spawning nothing.

     Balance note: the eight types are deliberately not equal. Artillery hits
     hardest and moves slowest; aviation crosses the map fastest and costs the
     most to keep in the air.
-->

